# Domain adaptation record

This repository assumes a multi-tenant product whose customer boundary is a
`{{.Recipe.Domain.Tenant}}`.

## Approved targeting vocabulary

{{range .Recipe.Domain.TargetingAttributes}}- `{{.}}`
{{end}}
Dotted attribute names are flat evaluation-context keys on the wire, never
nested objects. `targetingKey` is required and should be pseudonymous. Add
personal or sensitive attributes only after an explicit privacy decision,
positive tests, and rejection tests. Definitions cannot depend on unknown
request context.

## Authority

One configured management principal publishes definitions and becomes the audit
actor. A separate evaluation credential can read decisions but cannot write.

## Adaptation record

Add a dated entry for every targeting-vocabulary change. Name the operator
decision, behavior and test changes, and privacy consequence.
